{{!-- Every writer on a post, each name linking to their archive.

	{{> "byline-links" linkClass="font-ui text-text text-sm font-semibold no-underline"}}

	linkClass   the class list the Surface draws its byline links with

The linked half of byline.hbs — see that file for why Ghost's own {{authors}} helper is not used
here, and why the credit names everyone while the face stays the primary author's.

`../linkClass` and not `linkClass`: {{#foreach}} renders its block with each row as the context,
so a partial argument passed to THIS partial is one frame up from inside the loop. Read bare it is
undefined and every byline link ships `class=""`. --}}
{{~#foreach authors~}}
	{{~#unless @first}}{{#if @last}}{{t " and "}}{{else}}, {{/if}}{{/unless~}}
	<a
		href="{{url}}"
		class="{{../linkClass}}">{{name}}</a>
{{~/foreach~}}
